/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 63 0 R
/E (This project uses the Tweets.csv dataset containing tweets directed at major U.S. airlines. Each observation represents one tweet and includes a sentiment label: negative, neutral, or positive. The dataset also contains useful contextual variables such as the airline name, sentiment confidence score, negative reason, tweet creation time, and retweet count.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
