/Title (The word patterns are consistent with the sentiment labels. Negative tweets are dominated by words such as cancelled, service, hours, help, and delayed. Neutral tweets mainly contain request-like or informational words such as please, need, and when. Positive tweets are centered around gratitude and praise, especially thanks, thank, great, love, and awesome. 5.2 Model comparison on the validation set)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 399 0 R
/Next 394 0 R
>>
