398 0 obj
<<
/Title (US Airways has the highest percentage of negative tweets, followed by American and United. Virgin America is the most balanced airline and has the largest positive share. This suggests important differences in customer experience and public perception across airlines.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 396 0 R
/Next 400 0 R
>>
